| g6-computing-eras: who shaped three eras of computing, and how they interacted | 6 | g7-impact-history | One technology's intended and unintended effects |
| g6-human-decisions: the ethical and social consequences of people's choices in using and designing computing | 6 | g7-when-to-use-ai | When AI or another emerging technology suits a task |

Every hand-on above is answered by that row's assumes in data/progressions/computer-science.csv. Grade 6 is the year
before grade 7, so each grade 7 row above opens as a retrieval task inside its first day, except where unit 4 was
left out (Swap or leave out).

